OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 17, arrested after scaling
OL,4,Atelecoms tower
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17-year-old boy has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter he scaled a telecoms tower,
OL,8,Fresulting in road closures in
OL,9,FNorthampton town centre.
OL,11,FThe incident unfolded behind a Lidl
OL,12,Fstore in Towcester Road between 11:30
OL,13,Fand 13:30 GMT on Sunday.
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire Police urged motorists
OL,16,Fto avoid the area while they were at
OL,17,Fthe scene.
OL,19,FThe teenager was arrested on suspicion
OL,20,Fof causing a public nuisance and
OL,21,Finterfering with national
OL,22,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
